   "id": "ceaf8676",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Recovery gap** = log(NDVI recovery ratio) - log(sightings recovery ratio).\n",
    "Zero means vegetation and wildlife recovered by the same proportional amount;\n",
    "positive means vegetation recovered *relatively better* than wildlife did.\n",
    "\n",
